WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.024
iOS 27 lets

00:00:01.836 --> 00:00:02.944
two iPhones share

00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:03.746
one phone number

00:00:04.278 --> 00:00:05.292
A new iOS

00:00:05.103 --> 00:00:06.836
27 feature iPhone

00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:07.391
Handoff

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.157
lets you keep

00:00:07.969 --> 00:00:08.865
the same phone

00:00:08.677 --> 00:00:09.549
number on two

00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:10.127
iPhones

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.518
unlocking either one

00:00:11.342 --> 00:00:12.131
makes the number

00:00:11.943 --> 00:00:12.827
active on it

00:00:13.366 --> 00:00:14.757
Carrier services like

00:00:14.569 --> 00:00:15.759
call forwarding are

00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:16.420
managed on the

00:00:16.232 --> 00:00:17.269
main iPhone

00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:18.637
and carrier support

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.297
is limited for

00:00:19.109 --> 00:00:19.639
now

00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:21.258
Switching to Tello

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.072
Mobile can bring

00:00:21.884 --> 00:00:22.520
the cost of

00:00:22.332 --> 00:00:23.157
your plan down

00:00:22.969 --> 00:00:24.018
to as little

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:24.926
as $5 a

00:00:24.738 --> 00:00:25.280
month

00:00:25.422 --> 00:00:26.494
or an unlimited

00:00:26.306 --> 00:00:27.261
plan for just

00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:28.487
$25 a month

00:00:28.665 --> 00:00:29.855
all on America’s

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.459
largest 5G network

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.012
Full story on

00:00:32.823 --> 00:00:33.719
the dashboard
